33351::$$$message_0261_0007_0000$$$::She says that, but...[lr]::
33352::$$$message_0261_0007_0001$$$::I've always had a crush on Tohsaka ever since I started going to Homurahara Academy.[lr]::
33353::$$$message_0261_0007_0002$$$::Over time, I learned her true nature and got on the receiving end of her ridiculous behavior. Before I knew it, we became friends who could poke fun at each other.::
33354::$$$message_0261_0008_0000$$$::"It wasn't supposed to be like this... I feel pathetic."[lr]::
33355::$$$message_0261_0008_0001$$$::But still, I yearned for her.[lr]::
